Neuralink gave Noland Arbaugh something to wake up for.

“I didn’t have anything to wake up for in the morning, and this has changed that for me.”

@elonmusk  says he’s fairly confident Neuralink could restore full-body functionality at some point in the future—not a capability achieved today.

